title Vinyl P2a: a notice over a Menu page (a 15-minute timer with 2 s left ends while the Sleep timer page shows: "Sleep timer ended. Paused." over the page's bottom, the timer back to Off) (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm: ROW 44, the approved 480x320 layout's volume group and seek row 43 px (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE sleep
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 15
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 2

wait 600
shot 01-sleep-running
expect text "STOP PLAYING AFTER"
wait 2600
shot 02-sleep-ended
expect text "Sleep timer ended. Paused."
expect text "STOP PLAYING AFTER"
expect noquit
